          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP404 Edworthy South [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Despite all the leaves, a pretty quick find after an appointment. The helpful wooden stake was, well, helpful. TFTBC.&lt;/p&gt;

